# Dual-Use Content Disclosure

`ctf-agent` is software for authorized Capture The Flag (CTF) competitions and
educational security labs. It provides agent-facing instructions and MCP tools
for challenge-scoped web and network testing, binary reverse engineering,
forensics, cryptography exercises, and game-hacking challenges. Some included
techniques and tools are dual-use and could be misused outside those settings.

Use the package only on challenge assets and systems that you own or that the
competition organizer has explicitly authorized. Set and review the declared
challenge scope before active network testing. Do not use it to access systems
without authorization, steal credentials, deploy malware, or persist on systems.

CTF-Agent's scope checks and WSL account are guardrails, not a security sandbox.
The host and WSL environment may retain network access and host integration;
users remain responsible for authorization and for reviewing tool actions.
